lower shop and use your green thumb to improve the entire neighborhood</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269700/extras/456328f6c197fae60cd18baaaf267382.poster.avif?t=1706274776\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269700/extras/456328f6c197fae60cd18baaaf267382.webm?t=1706274776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2269700/extras/456328f6c197fae60cd18baaaf267382.mp4?t=1706274776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
